<div class="wrap">

  <header class="hero sticker-zone">
    <div class="filecode">FILE ZOTV-000 // OPEN ACCESS</div>
    <h1 class="hero-title">What happens between the whistle and the credits</h1>
    <p class="hero-sub">A record of how the show gets built — and a few things the show itself hasn't told you yet.</p>
